    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="144" width="400" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" wrap="false"><p>① 全栈工程能力</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="170" width="396" height="62"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" color="rgba(196,208,224,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>独立完成前后端分离系统，熟练掌握 Spring Boot 3、Vue 3、MyBatis-Plus、JWT 等主流技术与协作流程。</p></content></shape>

    <line startX="496" startY="134" endX="896" endY="134"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="144" width="400" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" wrap="false"><p>② 复杂业务建模能力</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="170" width="400" height="62"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" color="rgba(196,208,224,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>把干部“选、育、管、用”制度抽象为数据模型与状态流转，真正体会到业务驱动设计的含义。</p></content></shape>

    <line startX="64" startY="246" endX="460" endY="246"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="256" width="400" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" wrap="false"><p>③ 工程化与容错思维</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="282" width="396" height="62"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" color="rgba(196,208,224,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>通过单一数据源一致性、缓存降级、热切换防误操作等设计，学会为“异常情况”和长期可维护性而设计。</p></content></shape>

    <line startX="496" startY="246" endX="896" endY="246"><border color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" width="2"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="256" width="400" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" wrap="false"><p>④ 安全与规范意识</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="282" width="400" height="62"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" color="rgba(196,208,224,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>系统实践认证授权、行级数据权限、操作留痕与接口文档，形成了较规范的分层开发习惯。</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="362" width="832" height="86">
