    <shape type="text" topLeftX="84" topLeftY="374" width="800" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" bold="true" color="rgba(201,166,107,1)" wrap="false"><p>不足与后续展望</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="84" topLeftY="402" width="792" height="40"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11.5" color="rgba(214,224,236,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p>审批流程仍以固定阶段为主，后续可向可配置工作流演进；并计划补充 Redis 集群、国产化数据库适配与移动端体验优化。</p></content></shape>

    <line startX="64" startY="470" endX="896" endY="470"><border color="rgba(255,255,255,0.16)" width="1"/></line>
